      "side": 1,
      "message": "Transform never returns nil. If the transformer function returns nil, the original starlarkExpr will be returned unchanged.\n\nI considered allowing transform to return nil, but it becomes difficult to figure out what to do when a child of another expression is nil. For example, when the array/index in an indexExpr becomes nil.",
